OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy cloud in southeast
OL,6,FEngland clearing. Sunny spells for
OL,7,Fmany, but showers continuing across
OL,8,Fnorthern areas, becoming more
OL,9,Fwidespread later and locally heavy.
OL,10,FRisk of isolated thunderstorms in
OL,11,FScotland and Northern Ireland. Cool in
OL,12,Fthe northwest, with fresher conditions
OL,13,Felsewhere.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTonight:FShowers in the north easing
OL,16,Fand becoming confined to western
OL,17,Fareas. Mostly dry with clear spells
OL,18,Felsewhere, with some showers in East
OL,19,FAnglia. Cooler overnight in the
OL,20,Fsoutheast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
