OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMostly dry with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. Showers affecting the far
OL,7,Fnorth, locally heavy, with a slight
OL,8,Fchance of thunderstorms. Rather cool
OL,9,Fin the north, locally warm in the
OL,10,Fsouth.
